Adds MIDI Clock synchronization on top of M6 performance.

Includes:
- INTERNAL clock source using the existing Browser Companion transport as master;
- MIDI Clock Out at 24 PPQN;
- Start/Stop realtime messages on transport when enabled;
- independent clock-out enable for logical ports A–D;
- EXTERNAL MIDI Clock source with selectable Web MIDI input;
- MIDI Start / Continue / Stop handling;
- six incoming MIDI clocks = one 1/16 sequencer step;
- rolling BPM detection from recent clock intervals with outlier trimming;
- external slave engine reads the same persisted 64-track musical state and uses sequenceEventsAtTick();
- external sequencing preserves velocity, probability, gate, ratchet, CC locks and plans upcoming steps so negative microtiming is not simply clipped after a clock boundary;
- Follow updates the visible sequence page during external playback;
- All Notes Off / note cleanup on external Stop;
- sync settings persist separately from the musical project state;
- Ableton Link intentionally remains a later dedicated stage rather than being represented as MIDI Clock.

